Privacy Policy for "WHOears" App

This application requires access to the microphone exclusively to measure environmental noise levels in real time during auditory tests. 
No audio is recorded, stored, or transmitted to any server. All processing happens locally on the device. 
We do not collect, share, or sell any personal information.

Data retention and deletion

WHOears does not collect or store any personal data. Therefore, there is no data retained and no data to delete. 
This application is designed to operate entirely on-device, ensuring user privacy at all times.

User settings configuration

Application settings related to app usage and configuration are stored locally on the device to support app functionality. 
These settings do not contain personal data and are not transmitted, shared, or stored externally.
